    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u23f9\ufe0e Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been several hundred years since the last showdown of the &quot;Shrine Maiden&quot; and the &quot;King of Yokais,&quot; which led to the Shrine Maiden sealing the King of Yokais at the cost of her life. Nowadays, yokais are rarely seen, and those who used special power to fight against yokais back in the days brought their talent to a new type of competition, the &quot;Jinmu Festival,&quot; and competed against each other like celebrities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the King of Yokais never perished, and as its seal weakens day by day, the yokais hidden in the unmanned territory are starting to stir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, the Shrine Maiden in the current era, a girl named Rinne, has transferred to a school that specializes in cultivating Jinmu Festival players. While getting to know new companions and lovers here, Rinne will battle yokais and discover the secrets behind Shrine Maidens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u23f9\ufe0e Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a traditional RPG that also features yuri (girls' love) elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Rinne, can develop a romantic relationship with one of the female characters, fighting alongside her and uncovering the mysteries together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u23f9\ufe0e Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744880/extras/edf2516852d5415a3957bd27efd83f99.avif?t=1753344018\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Rinne\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine. A highborn young master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has been serving the Shrine Maiden's duty of fighting yokais and despises Jinmu Festivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744880/extras/bf0df2a6dd966da2b8ab545de3883136.avif?t=1753344018\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Yukiho\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rinne's childhood playmate and her maid. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She values her relationship with Rinne and has made many efforts to protect Rinne without her knowing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744880/extras/ec7cb0e30ec4c97803cc27af309daf59.avif?t=1753344018\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Ayame\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl born in an ordinary family and attended the school because of the principal's invitation, and has been striving to become a pro player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although she had the taste of her first defeat after Rinne transferred, she was not discouraged and saw Rinne as her goal and kept challenging her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744880/extras/915ba64cd3fb632f384618e7b3778d97.avif?t=1753344018\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Momo\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A petite and cute catgirl yokai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although Rinne attacked her when they first met, she did not hold a grudge and instead became one of her companions, fighting yokais by her side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is mischievous and often angers Rinne, who threatens to exorcise her every time they quarrel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, they seem to have known each other for a long time, even longer than Yukiho?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u23f9\ufe0e Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been several hundred years since the last showdown of the &quot;Shrine Maiden&quot; and the &quot;King of Yokais,&quot; which led to the Shrine Maiden sealing the King of Yokais at the cost of her life. Nowadays, yokais are rarely seen, and those who used special power to fight against yokais back in the days brought their talent to a new type of competition, the &quot;Jinmu Festival,&quot; and competed against each other like celebrities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the King of Yokais never perished, and as its seal weakens day by day, the yokais hidden in the unmanned territory are starting to stir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, the Shrine Maiden in the current era, a girl named Rinne, has transferred to a school that specializes in cultivating Jinmu Festival players. While getting to know new companions and lovers here, Rinne will battle yokais and discover the secrets behind Shrine Maidens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u23f9\ufe0e Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a traditional RPG that also features yuri (girls' love) elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Rinne, can develop a romantic relationship with one of the female characters, fighting alongside her and uncovering the mysteries together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u23f9\ufe0e Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744880/extras/edf2516852d5415a3957bd27efd83f99.avif?t=1753344018\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Rinne\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine. A highborn young master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has been serving the Shrine Maiden's duty of fighting yokais and despises Jinmu Festivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744880/extras/bf0df2a6dd966da2b8ab545de3883136.avif?t=1753344018\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Yukiho\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rinne's childhood playmate and her maid. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She values her relationship with Rinne and has made many efforts to protect Rinne without her knowing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744880/extras/ec7cb0e30ec4c97803cc27af309daf59.avif?t=1753344018\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Ayame\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl born in an ordinary family and attended the school because of the principal's invitation, and has been striving to become a pro player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although she had the taste of her first defeat after Rinne transferred, she was not discouraged and saw Rinne as her goal and kept challenging her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744880/extras/915ba64cd3fb632f384618e7b3778d97.avif?t=1753344018\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Momo\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A petite and cute catgirl yokai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although Rinne attacked her when they first met, she did not hold a grudge and instead became one of her companions, fighting yokais by her side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is mischievous and often angers Rinne, who threatens to exorcise her every time they quarrel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, they seem to have known each other for a long time, even longer than Yukiho?</p>",
